  "provenance": "All six arms measure c71364bd, the #70 firmware on dev 1767346a: entity_advertise() reports the enable it requested rather than an enabled entity, the restore wait reports at its timeout that the fabric holds the enable, and the PHY poll runs on every boot path past the CSR identity check. nvm_capture() and the census are unchanged, and so are dev's capture harness and RTL. Processor pins f65c8ff7 (protocol) and f97c1803 (gPTP). 39 of 96 captures repeat the previous receipt's system-cycle counts (f3bb2014). The six arms ran in two drivers of three, so at most two builds ran at once; independent simulations overlapped. The capture SoC has no Milan MAC MDIO CSR, so the PHY path is compiled out. ARM through ATTEST contains no heartbeat or PHY call.",
